### 9. Previous readings, newest first, paged
GET {{baseUrl}}/Observation?patient=Patient/{{patientId}}&_sort=-date&_count=5
Accept: application/fhir+json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 10. One vital type (local code)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Observation?patient=Patient/{{patientId}}&code=BP
Accept: application/fhir+json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 11. One vital type (LOINC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Observation?patient=Patient/{{patientId}}&code=http://loinc.org|8867-4
Accept: application/fhir+json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 12. Date range + category
GET {{baseUrl}}/Observation?patient=Patient/{{patientId}}&category=laboratory&date=ge2026-10-01&date=le2026-10-31
Accept: application/fhir+json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 13. Single Observation create (alternative to the batch)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Observation
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "resourceType": "Observation",
  "identifier": [{ "system": "http://fakeeh.example/medical-kit/reading-id", "value": "KIT-DEMO-SINGLE-0001" }],
  "status": "final",
  "code": { "coding": [{ "system": "http://fakeeh.example/medical-kit/vital-type", "code": "SPO2" }] },
  "subject": { "reference": "Patient/{{patientId}}" },
  "effectiveDateTime": "2026-10-19T09:15:00+03:00",
  "valueQuantity": { "value": 97, "unit": "%", "system": "http://unitsofmeasure.org", "code": "%" }
}
